816:- **This repo contains TWO TypeScript compilers and `pnpm exec` resolves the nearest one** (root pins typescript 7.0.2; apps/ui pins ^5.6.0 -> 5.9.3). Same tsconfig, same tree, DIFFERENT diagnostics: TS7 reports the side-effect `import "./globals.css"` as TS2882; TS 5.9.3 stays silent on it. Every compile gate must therefore pin the INVOCATION DIRECTORY (repo root is canonical for the ADR-006 gate), and a seat that reproduces a "phantom" baseline error should first check `pnpm exec tsc --version` from its own cwd. (Found by CODE-T9C3-REV2 N9, 2026-08-31 — the reviewer's own round-0 "layout.tsx CLEAN" record fell to exactly this.)
